{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなーーー∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただいまーーーっ\\( ^^)/♡\\(^^ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日パリから帰国しました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もしかしてだけど〜\n（もしかしてだけど）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もしかしてだけど〜\n（もしかしてだけど）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みーなぁさーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなったん不足なんじゃないのぉ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで取り急ぎ\nブログを書かせてもらってまーす♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、↑の歌はドブロックさんの\nネタを拝借いたしました（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれ好き(人-ω-)（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん...話がそれたけど\n今回は写メ多めな感じで\n行きたいと思いますヽ(｡･∀･)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パリが楽しくてマカロンが\n美味しくてテンション高めですが\n多めにみてください（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気分はパリジェンヌです←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/07/05/5687687/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凱旋門"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/07/05/5687687/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝市♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/07/05/5687687/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/07/05/5687687/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベルサイユ宮殿"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/07/05/5687687/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/07/05/5687687/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"天井も綺麗(っTωT)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/07/05/5687687/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこかのカップル（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/07/05/5687687/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マカロン"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/07/05/5687687/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マカロン"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/07/05/5687687/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マカロン（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな感じでパリを\n満喫させていただきました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当人も街も素敵すぎる\nところだったよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてメインは\nジャパンエキスポ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャパンエキスポは以前から\n知っていて日本の文化が\nフランスでも受け入れられているって\n素敵だなぁと思っていましたが\nまさかここに来て自分が\nジャパンエキスポに出させて\nいただくなんて思っても\nみなかったので、帰って来た今も\nなんだか不思議でなりません☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当夢みたい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもフランスのみなさんが\nライブで見せてくれた笑顔や\n声援を思い出すと\n夢じゃなかったんだなぁと\n改めて実感します(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初のフランスでのライブで\n乃木坂を知ってくれてる人が\n本当にいるのかなぁって\n不安がいっぱいだったけど\n言葉が通じないながらも\n歌とダンスを通じてフランスの\nみなさんとの距離を縮められて\nすごく嬉しかった♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もしまたライブを\nさせていただける機会が\nあったら言葉をたくさん覚えて\nもっとコミュニケーションを\n取れるようにしたいな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日本から駆けつけてくれた方も\nありがとうねヽ(〃v〃)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"国民的通り越して国際的アイドル\n目指すぞ〜(。-ω-)｡°｡°｡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひみなさん楽天koboで\n漫画や本を読んで日本の文化に\nたくさん触れましょーっ♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/07/05/5687687/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと大人数の私達がここに\n行きたいあそこに行きたいといって\n叶えてくれたスタッフさん達には\n本当に感謝です(´･ω･ゞ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しませてくれて\nありがとうございました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またパリ行きたいヽ(〃v〃)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからライブもあるし\nもっともっと頑張るぞっヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パリでも〜..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/07/05/5687687/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっっっっっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/07/05/5687687/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きゅんっっっ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(あ、モバメ通常通りまた\nラブラブしたメール送って行くので\n見逃しちゃダメだぞ〜っ♪♪)"}],"source":"archive"}